    "anchors": "p300 = AudioMemo light #54CDCC (OKLCH 0.78/0.107/195), p500 = AudioMemo deep #299898 (OKLCH 0.62/0.095/195); dark-mode p500 = #54CDCC",
    "method": "Each other step keeps the OKLCH lightness of the previous (Osmi-derived) primary scale, hue set to 195°, chroma multiplied by C(#299898)/C(old p500 #1479B8) = 0.739.",
