      "#062424 on #54CDCC": 8.54
    },
    "rules": "p500 for fills, icons and large text (>= 3:1). Small text in the primary color uses primaryText (AA >= 4.5:1). Neutrals, backgrounds, recording red and warning colors are unchanged. The Osmi transcribe button keeps Osmi blue #81BDD6."
